WEBVTT

NOTE English subtitles for the video "MEHI's voice agent" (narration in Spanish).

1
00:00:01.898 --> 00:00:03.457
It's three in the morning.

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.555
Someone needs to know how to complete a government procedure...

3
00:00:06.517 --> 00:00:08.842
and on the other end, someone answers.

4
00:00:10.925 --> 00:00:12.567
This is MEHI's voice agent.

5
00:00:13.186 --> 00:00:19.085
An artificial intelligence that answers real calls, in Spanish, as naturally as a person.

6
00:00:19.743 --> 00:00:22.340
Twenty-four hours a day, seven days a week.

7
00:00:22.963 --> 00:00:24.039
No lines.

8
00:00:24.661 --> 00:00:25.784
No waiting.

9
00:00:27.701 --> 00:00:34.225
When someone calls, the agent listens, understands what they need and answers with official, verified information.

10
00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:37.677
It logs the request, answers the question...

11
00:00:37.651 --> 00:00:43.031
and if they need to talk to someone, it transfers them to a human operator, with no need to call back.

12
00:00:45.005 --> 00:00:46.175
How is it built?

13
00:00:46.818 --> 00:00:49.026
With three layers that work together.

14
00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:54.097
A state-of-the-art voice engine that understands and speaks in real time.

15
00:00:54.696 --> 00:00:59.132
A conversation flow designed procedure by procedure, with clear rules.

16
00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:01.067
No improvising.

17
00:01:01.759 --> 00:01:07.469
And a knowledge base curated by people: every answer comes from an approved official record.

18
00:01:08.116 --> 00:01:09.652
Never from something made up.

19
00:01:11.573 --> 00:01:15.609
And behind every call is MEHI, the platform that oversees it all.

20
00:01:16.253 --> 00:01:17.930
Real-time metrics.

21
00:01:18.528 --> 00:01:21.172
Automatic analysis of every conversation.

22
00:01:21.783 --> 00:01:23.118
Quality alerts.

23
00:01:23.752 --> 00:01:26.997
And a team that reviews and improves the agent every day.

24
00:01:28.825 --> 00:01:34.500
Hundreds of simultaneous calls, with enterprise-grade security and personal data protection.

25
00:01:35.119 --> 00:01:37.480
Because on the other end, there are people.

26
00:01:39.611 --> 00:01:40.144
MEHI.

27
00:01:40.787 --> 00:01:42.912
Artificial intelligence that answers.

28
00:01:43.558 --> 00:01:44.811
Made in Argentina.
